{"unit_id":"Xliecc__dsh-session-theme#card-zh","repo":"Xliecc/dsh-session-theme","commit":"65c85e6cb711127a9bf8bb0925a9f508995c1a23","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-theme 是一款面向 DSH 网页端的会话主题显示插件。它作为宿主侧后台插件接入会话持久化与投影缓存服务，在启动时检查已持久化的会话，跳过当前已加载或缓存已有标题的会话，并为缺少标题投影的冷会话执行冷读和缓存预热。之后会话列表可直接带上标题，让左侧边栏在尚未点开会话时也显示真实主题。遇到单条会话日志读取失败时会记录警告并继续处理其它会话；浏览器端模块是空操作占位。适合希望快速辨认多个历史会话的 DSH 网页用户；无需额外密钥或外部服务，需由 DSH 提供相关会话服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-65","lib/client.js:8-17"]}
{"unit_id":"Xliecc__dsh-session-theme#card-en","repo":"Xliecc/dsh-session-theme","commit":"65c85e6cb711127a9bf8bb0925a9f508995c1a23","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-theme warms missing session title projections at startup so cold sessions show their themes in the DSH web sidebar before opening. It skips live or already titled sessions and logs failed reads while continuing. It uses DSH session services and needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:26-65","lib/client.js:8-17"]}
